<a href="https://github.com/puretechteam/bible-widget">Bible Widget</a> by <a href="https://github.com/puretechteam">Pure Tech</a> is marked <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0 1.0 Universal</a><img src="https://mirrors.creativecommons.org/presskit/icons/cc.svg" alt="" style="max-width: 1em;max-height:1em;margin-left: .2em;"><img src="https://mirrors.creativecommons.org/presskit/icons/zero.svg" alt="" style="max-width: 1em;max-height:1em;margin-left: .2em;">

The CC0 mark covers the app's own code, icons and menu text. It does not cover the Bible texts, the language names, or the software the download is built with, which keep their own terms, listed below. The prayers in `prayers/prayers.json` are passages from the Bibles below.

## Bible texts

Every Bible is recorded in `bibles/index.json` with its license, year and source, and the build refuses to include one that is not public domain or under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Public domain: published before 1930 and old enough that the translators' rights have ended (or, for the Bible in Basic English, published without a copyright notice), with no one claiming rights to the text today (apart from the King James Version's printing patent in the United Kingdom, below).

| File | Translation | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `ar_svd` | The Arabic Bible (Smith and Van Dyck, 1865) | thiagobodruk/bible |
| `cs_kralicka` | Bible kralická (1613) | eBible.org `ces1613` |
| `da_1871` | Danish Bible (Old Testament 1871, New Testament 1907) | CrossWire `DaOT1871NT1907` |
| `nl_sv1917` | De Heilige Schrift (Statenvertaling, 1917 printing) | eBible.org `nld` |
| `en_asv` | American Standard Version (1901) | scrollmapper/bible_databases |
| `en_bbe` | Bible in Basic English (1965; public domain in the United States, where it was published without a copyright notice) | thiagobodruk/bible |
| `en_darby` | Darby Translation (1890) | eBible.org `engDBY` |
| `en_geneva` | Geneva Bible (1599, electronic edition by Mark Langley) | scrollmapper/bible_databases |
| `en_kjv` | King James Version (1769; in the United Kingdom, the Crown holds a perpetual royal patent on printing it) | thiagobodruk/bible |
| `en_webster` | Webster's Bible (1833) | scrollmapper/bible_databases |
| `en_ylt` | Young's Literal Translation (1898) | scrollmapper/bible_databases |
| `eo_esperanto` | La Sankta Biblio (Old Testament by L. L. Zamenhof; 1926) | thiagobodruk/bible |
| `fi_finnish` | Biblia (1776) | thiagobodruk/bible |
