| `es_rvr` | Reina-Valera (1909) | thiagobodruk/bible |
| `sv_1917` | Bibeln (1917) | CrossWire `Swe1917` |
| `tl_angbiblia` | Ang Biblia (1905) | CrossWire `TagAngBiblia` |
| `uk_kulish` | Kulish, Puluj and Nechuy-Levytsky Bible (1905) | eBible.org `ukr1871` |
| `vi_vietnamese` | Vietnamese Bible (William Cadman and others; New Testament 1923, Old Testament 1925) | thiagobodruk/bible |

Corrections: where a source file had lost verses, merged them into the verse before, or run words together, the files were repaired from other public domain copies of the same editions: eBible.org (`eng-asv`, `enggnv`, `engWycliffe`, `vie1934`, `arb-vd`, `ces1613`, `pesOPV`), CrossWire (`Geneva1599`, `FinBiblia`, `Viet`, `HebDelitzsch`, `FarOPV`), the Danish Bible's own source files (https://github.com/emg/Danish-Bible-OT-1871 and https://github.com/emg/Danish-Bible-NT-1907), the Károli Biblia's (https://github.com/krisek/HunKar, with three lost verses from https://github.com/gabordobrei/karoli-biblia-citatumokkal) and a second copy of the Biblia Gdańska (https://github.com/adampaulukanis/gdanska). Typing errors such as a digit for a letter, stray signs and missing spaces were corrected by hand.

